oopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Leather_1_Red+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Stealthy\" title=\"Stealthy\">Stealthy</a></dt><dd>Gain a +1 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth Checks</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Home\" title=\"Highberry's Home\">Highberry's Home</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;20&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-34</span>: Worn by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/25px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/38px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/50px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dolor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/25px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\">Dolor</a> the assassin</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fraygo%27s_Flophouse\" title=\"Fraygo's Flophouse\">Fraygo's Flophouse</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-14&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;75</span>: In the Shabby Wardobe in the secret room of the attic</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If Dolor is not killed at Highberry's Home, he can later be found at the <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a>.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Appearance in game</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 153.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 151.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_female.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_female.PNG/227px-Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_female.PNG.webp, /w/images/4/49/Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_female.PNG 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Leather Armour Icon worn by Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_female.PNG/227px-Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_female.PNG.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"152\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_female.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 140.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 138.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_male.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_male.PNG/208px-Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_male.PNG.webp, /w/images/6/62/Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_male.PNG 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Scarlet Leather Armour worn by Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_male.PNG/208px-Scarlet_Leather_Armour_in_game_male.PNG.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"139\" height=\"300